.DS_Store

# local tool settings
# Agent tooling: installed skill packs and local session state. Large, machine
# specific, and regenerated on demand — never part of the project.
.claude/

# planning documents — working notes, deliberately not part of the repository
gart-master-plan.md
gart-roadmap.md
gart-presentation.md
